    "Company About Us Overview Innovation Our Locations Careers Investors Capital Corporate Responsibility Overview Sustainability People Supply Chain Ethics Philanthropy Data Privacy News & Events Newsroom Press Releases Events Blog Posts Shopping for business? Join our business program today to get tiered pricing, rewards for your purchases, and more exclusive benefits. See All Benefits Sign Up Now Tiered Pricing for Business Members Get special rates on select products. New products added monthly. p.nav-promo-tiered-pricing { background-image: url(\"https://www.westerndigital.com/content/dam/store/en-us/assets/business/icons/icon-tiered-pricing-53.png\"); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding-left: 67px; padding-top: 5px; min-height: 60px; } See All Products with Tiered Pricing",
    "Tomorrow’s innovations start with today’s brightest minds. We offer incredible opportunities to launch your career and develop your skills as you grow alongside one of the world’s most respected companies.",
    "Let’s create new possibilities together.",
    "Internships are a great way to explore our culture and gain invaluable industry experience.",
    "As a WD intern, you’ll help provide solutions to real-world problems, develop your network by attending onsite and offsite networking events, and learn directly from our senior leadership and industry experts through our Early Talent Learning Series.",
    "Set your future in motion at a company that gives you the tools to realize your potential. Our Early Talent Program gives you and your fellow new college hires twelve months of programs and events designed specifically to jumpstart your WD career. The Early Talent Program is open to all eligible students regardless of age and will be inclusive of older individuals and veterans who returned to school.",
    "The Early Talent Learning Series is an opportunity to hear directly from senior leadership and industry experts across a variety of functional areas such as engineering, global operations and business services. This series features speakers who share their wealth of experience, offering in-depth insights, practical career advice and functional overviews of our different business units. Each session is designed to equip you with tips for success and provide the inspiration you need to kick-start your career in your chosen field.",
    "• Executive leadership exposure and introduction to different parts of the organization • Specially curated professional and personal development activities • Networking social events with other program participants",
    "No. To be eligible for an internship, you must still be enrolled in a university or equivalent-level school and have at least one term remaining after internship completion.",
    "Prospective candidates can apply for early talent roles if they have graduated from a university within the past 24 months and it would be their first professional role leveraging their degree.",
    "Our internship and early talent opportunities can be found on our job openings page. To be considered, students must be available at the start date and for the duration of the program.",
    "Yes, all WD interns are paid.",
    "Yes, all early talent positions are full-time roles and those hired will be considered a full-time employee.",
    "Based on your degree type and prior experience, you may be eligible for early talent and professional level roles. Please check each job posting for specific qualifications.",
    "Opportunities are posted year-round (based on global academic calendars below). Applicants are encouraged to apply early.",
    "Each application is reviewed against the requirements of the position as listed in the job description. Students or graduates who meet the qualifications may be invited to interview with a recruiter followed by interview(s) with hiring manager(s). After all interviews are conducted, an offer will be extended to the strongest candidate(s).",
    "Yes, students or graduates can submit applications for multiple roles.",
    "We offer internships in areas such as engineering, operations, finance, sales & marketing, people solutions, etc.",
    "Our most common internship runs for 12 weeks.",
    "We look to hire students at the Bachelors, Masters and PhD levels.",
    "Relocation is offered at the discretion of the hiring manager.",
    "Early talent and intern positions will align to the site-based working arrangements. As an example, for the main U.S. office locations, a hybrid working schedule applies with in-office work on collaboration days.",
    "While you are not guaranteed a job offer, WD prioritizes hiring former interns into early talent roles. Our goal is to have high-potential early talent return to have a successful career with WD.",
    "Western Digital is committed to providing equal opportunities to all applicants and employees and will not discriminate against any applicant or employee based on their protected class status. We also prohibit harassment of any individual based on their protected class status. For more information about our non-discrimination and non-harassment policy, click here.",
    "Western Digital is committed to offering opportunities to applicants with a disability. If you need a reasonable accommodation, email us at jobs.accomodations@wdc.com. In your email, please include a description of the specific accommodation you are requesting as well as the job title and requisition number of the position for which you are applying.",
    "Notice To Candidates: Western Digital and its subsidiaries will never request payment as a condition for applying for a position or receiving an offer of employment. Should you encounter any such requests, please report it immediately to Western Digital Ethics Helpline or email compliance@wdc.com.",
